1
00:00:00,135 --> 00:00:01,199
Gelap malam.

2
00:00:01,219 --> 00:00:02,282
Gelap lautan.

3
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:03,424
Gelap perut ikan.

4
00:00:03,444 --> 00:00:04,786
Dari dalam tiga kegelapan itu,

5
00:00:04,806 --> 00:00:05,977
satu doa pendek didengar.

6
00:00:05,997 --> 00:00:07,603
Nabi Yunus diutus kepada

7
00:00:07,623 --> 00:00:08,502
kaumnya.

8
00:00:08,522 --> 00:00:09,136
Dalam riwayat,

9
00:00:09,156 --> 00:00:10,731
kaum itu tinggal di Niniwe,

10
00:00:10,751 --> 00:00:12,097
kini wilayah Irak.

11
00:00:12,117 --> 00:00:13,382
Seruannya ditolak.

12
00:00:13,402 --> 00:00:14,442
Al-Qur'an menyebut,

13
00:00:14,462 --> 00:00:15,665
ia lalu pergi dalam keadaan

14
00:00:15,685 --> 00:00:16,140
marah.

15
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,766
Ia naik ke kapal yang penuh

16
00:00:17,786 --> 00:00:18,503
muatan.

17
00:00:18,523 --> 00:00:19,493
Di tengah laut,

18
00:00:19,513 --> 00:00:20,927
penumpang diundi.

19
00:00:20,947 --> 00:00:22,348
Undian jatuh pada Yunus,

20
00:00:22,368 --> 00:00:24,606
dan ia pun keluar dari kapal.

21
00:00:24,626 --> 00:00:26,406
Seekor ikan besar menelannya.

22
00:00:26,426 --> 00:00:27,753
Ibnu Mas'ud menafsirkan

23
00:00:27,773 --> 00:00:29,038
kegelapan dalam ayat itu:

24
00:00:29,058 --> 00:00:30,281
gelap perut ikan,

25
00:00:30,301 --> 00:00:31,127
gelap laut,

26
00:00:31,147 --> 00:00:32,010
dan gelap malam.

27
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:33,472
Di sanalah Yunus berdoa:

28
00:00:33,492 --> 00:00:35,129
Lā ilāha illā anta,

29
00:00:35,149 --> 00:00:37,098
subḥānaka, innī kuntu

30
00:00:37,118 --> 00:00:38,738
minaẓ-ẓālimīn.

31
00:00:38,758 --> 00:00:39,311
Artinya:

32
00:00:39,331 --> 00:00:41,525
tidak ada tuhan selain Engkau,

33
00:00:41,545 --> 00:00:42,871
Mahasuci Engkau,

34
00:00:42,891 --> 00:00:43,893
sungguh aku termasuk

35
00:00:43,913 --> 00:00:45,276
orang-orang yang zalim.

36
00:00:45,296 --> 00:00:47,350
Ia tidak menyalahkan kaumnya,

37
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:48,607
tidak juga lautnya.

38
00:00:48,627 --> 00:00:49,799
Ia mengakui kesalahannya

39
00:00:49,819 --> 00:00:50,454
sendiri.

40
00:00:50,474 --> 00:00:51,650
Surah Ash-Shaffat menyebut,

41
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,461
seandainya ia bukan orang yang

42
00:00:53,481 --> 00:00:54,901
banyak bertasbih,

43
00:00:54,921 --> 00:00:56,810
ia akan tetap di perut ikan

44
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:58,033
sampai hari kebangkitan.

45
00:00:58,053 --> 00:00:59,277
Doanya dikabulkan.

46
00:00:59,297 --> 00:01:00,562
Ia dilemparkan ke daratan

47
00:01:00,582 --> 00:01:02,250
tandus dalam keadaan sakit,

48
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:03,952
lalu tumbuh pohon dari jenis

49
00:01:03,972 --> 00:01:05,923
labu untuk menaunginya.

50
00:01:05,943 --> 00:01:07,424
Ia diutus lagi kepada seratus

51
00:01:07,444 --> 00:01:08,924
ribu orang atau lebih.

52
00:01:08,944 --> 00:01:10,514
Kali ini mereka beriman.

53
00:01:10,534 --> 00:01:12,434
Surah Yunus menyebut kaumnya

54
00:01:12,454 --> 00:01:13,826
sebagai pengecualian:

55
00:01:13,846 --> 00:01:15,732
iman mereka bermanfaat,

56
00:01:15,752 --> 00:01:17,629
dan azab diangkat dari mereka.

57
00:01:17,649 --> 00:01:18,976
Rasulullah bersabda,

58
00:01:18,996 --> 00:01:20,771
doa Yunus ini,

59
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:22,551
tidaklah dibaca seorang muslim

60
00:01:22,571 --> 00:01:24,328
untuk urusan apa pun,

61
00:01:24,348 --> 00:01:26,514
kecuali Allah mengabulkannya.

62
00:01:26,534 --> 00:01:28,077
Kapan terakhir kali kamu

63
00:01:28,097 --> 00:01:29,591
berani mengakui salah,

64
00:01:29,611 --> 00:01:31,574
tanpa mencari kambing hitam?

